# Ghost Job Detector — Environment Variables
#
# There are NO required environment variables for deployment.
# The Next.js API route reads the OpenAI key from the x-openai-key request
# header only (BYOK design). There is intentionally no OPENAI_API_KEY
# server-side fallback — this is by design, not an oversight.
#
# Optional (development only):
# OPENAI_API_KEY_EVAL is used ONLY by the scoring engine calibration script
# (npm run calibrate --workspace=@ghost/scoring). It is never read by the
# API route and never deployed to Vercel.

# OPENAI_API_KEY_EVAL=sk-...   # local calibration only — never deploy this
